module

public import Theory.SpecificGroups.Janko4.Model.Simplicity.PrimeCoverage.Elevens.LocalCertificates.Coordinates

/-!
# Witnesses for the two cyclic orbits in the eleven-coordinate group

Each row gives a representative index, exponent, and word in the four actions
`u,v,x,y`. These are untrusted search output: `OrbitCertificates` checks every
row in the Lean kernel. The action convention is conjugation by the inverse
on the left, as in the ATLAS J4G1-max7W1 local calculation.
-/

